Inclusion Criteria:
  -  Children  [AND] with ASD  [OR] or high risk for autism;
  -  Han ethic;
  -  Parents were at least middle school educated, [AND]  and agreed to do at least 20 hours per week of planned practice activities with the child in daily life

right.raw_text:
Exclusion Criteria:
  -  Children  [AND] with Syndromic ASD caused by known genetic defects  [OR] or inherited metabolic diseases , such as Rett Syndrome, [OR]  Fragile X Syndrome, [OR]  Angelman Syndrome, [OR]  Prader-Willi Syndrome, [OR]  tuberous sclerosis;
  -  Visual, [OR]  auditory  [OR] and physical disabilities;
  -  Complication with other serious chronic diseases, such as liver  [OR] and kidney failure, [OR]  connective tissue diseases, [OR]  tumors
